      "message": "fix(shared-audit): v1.1-negative r2 - purge 4 leak-type records (post-review)\n\nIndependent review flagged leak-type rejections (refusal that spills\ninternal system-prompt rules). Full re-audit found 4, not 2:\n- REQ-NEG-dc712c22-009 (v42-sys): leaked '家法第一条' rule text\n- REQ-NEG-4a41a796-013 (v43-v2): leaked P0-meltdown reason phrase\n- REQ-NEG-d2c047bf-015 (v43-v2): leaked system-prompt structure\n- REQ-NEG-25890147-027 (v43): leaked training-time instruction fragment\n\nPurged all 4, added 4 clean refusals from candidate pool (qwen academic,\nv43 morse-您/safety-audit/startup-flow). v42-sys had no remaining clean\nrejection -> honestly dropped (7->6 models). dna_sig uniqueness clarified\nin SCHEMA.md §6 (identity by request_id, dna_sig inherits prompt DNA so\ncross-model repeats are expected).\n\n- Dataset SHA-256: 156d3ebb...7378 (was b78c9509)\n- SCHEMA.md rev2 + README + MANIFEST updated\n- All 6 files GPG re-signed: A2D0092CEE2E5BA87035600924C3704A8CC26D5F\n\nDNA: #龍芯⚡️2026-08-21-V1.1-NEG-R2-PURGE-v1.0",
